---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site.config';

const pageTitle = `Legal na Paunawa • ${siteConfig.brand.name}`;
const pageDesc = "Opisyal na legal na paunawa para sa Utopia POS ng StellarSoft.";
---

<BaseLayout locale="fil" title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  <section class="legal-page-section">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <a href="/fil/" class="back-link">← Bumalik sa simula</a>

      <h1 class="legal-title">Legal na Paunawa</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">May-akda: StellarSoft • Software: Utopia POS</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Tagapaglathala ng Software at Website</h2>
        <p>
          Ang POS at retail management software na <strong>Utopia POS</strong> at ang website na ito ay binuo at inilathala ng <strong>StellarSoft</strong>.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Kumpanya:</strong> StellarSoft</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> contact@stellarsoft.com</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Support:</strong> Direktang suporta sa negosyo at teknikal</li>
          <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11 (64-bit)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Lahat ng trademark, logo, disenyo ng user interface, source code, at nakasulat na nilalaman ay eksklusibong pag-aari ng StellarSoft.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Offline na Operasyon at Pananagutan</h2>
        <p>
          Ang Utopia POS ay ibinibigay para sa lokal at autonomous na paggamit sa kompyuter ng tindahan. Ang may-ari ay may pananagutan sa kanyang lokal na backup ng data at pagsunod sa mga umiiral na batas sa negosyo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page-section {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
    background-color: var(--content-bg);
    color: var(--content-text);
    min-height: 70vh;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .back-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--content-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--content-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--content-text);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    color: var(--content-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--content-text);
  }
</style>
